    "short_description": "Adventure platformer about Potata's travel in fairy forest. Reveal all secrets and hidden treasures and don't forget to save the world.",
    "supported_languages": "English, Russian",
    "reviews": "\u201cI am very impressed with the quality of the title; I have had a magnificent time with my game-play so far. It has casual to challenging game-play that players of most skill levels can enjoy. The artwork of the title is imaginative and visually striking, and is accompanied by a magical soundtrack that matches the game wonderfully. The varying parkour is a lot of fun and not overly challenging; I have had a lot of fun exploring the different chapters in search of items and secrets. It has a very interesting set of mechanics driving the title and it was a blast discovering them. With a very fair price point for the amount of gameplay, it is great value for one's library.\u201d<br>9.0 \u2013 Zeepond<br><br>\u201cRelaxing Potaty gameplay makes us feel how stress is escaping from us, and the pleasant visual and audiovisual setting only intensifies this effect.\u201d<br>7.0 \u2013 GamerWeb<br><br>\u201cPotata is a highly recommended game if you are looking for a light adventure to start the year and a must for lovers of classic platforms. Its beautiful artistic section, its interesting difficulty and how absorbing its experience turns it into a very pleasant surprise.\u201d<br>8.0 \u2013 Navigames<br>",
